  "changes": [
    "STRING 0.9.0, a Karplus-Strong plucked string SRC machine in slot 8, imported unchanged from the author's sources at commit 69ab748 (digitakt.c, karplus.c, ui.c, cm_ui.h and their headers), with the generators of its two tables (scripts/gen_tables.py, scripts/gen_icons.py).",
    "STRING requires Machine Pages and patches no firmware bytes: it contributes its machine to core_machines, Machine Pages draws its SRC page from its cm_ui descriptor, and its render subscribes to ev_render_voices at order 20. build.json is the author's mod.json; the 1.54 release adds only the -DDIGISTRING_OS154 cflag. Source-only export compiled in the pinned GCC 16.2 Docker toolchain; STRING-fast is not imported."
  ],
